  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a medium saucepan, bring the water (for the rice) to the boil. Add basmati rice, stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low.\n• Cook for 10 mins, then remove pan from heat and keep covered until the rice is tender and the water has absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5f4f3a3e881d705d0f58bd10/step-4b6d3ba2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice red onion. Cut capsicum into 1cm pieces. Grate zucchini. Finely chop or crush garlic. Drain and rinse black beans. Zest lime to get a pinch and slice into wedges.\n• In a small bowl, combine lime zest, a squeeze of lime juice and sour cream. Season to taste. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5f4f3a3e881d705d0f58bd10/step-e2be7fe0.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook onion and capsicum until softened, 4-5 mins.\n• Add zucchini and black beans. Cook until tender, 2-3 mins.\n• Stir in Mexican seasoning, the butter, tomato paste and garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 min.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5f4f3a3e881d705d0f58bd10/step-69fffe11.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add water (for the sauce) and crumbled stock (1 cube for 2P / 2 cubes for 4P). Reduce heat to low and simmer until slightly thickened, 3-4 mins. Season to taste.\n• Divide rice between bowls and top with black bean chilli.\n• Serve with zesty sour cream and lime wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5f4f3a3e881d705d0f58bd10/step-4328136b.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
